        "description": "__Debut date:__ January 3, 2020\n__Height:__ 150 cm\n__Fanbase name:__ Kin of Tokoyami\n__Illustrator:__ [rurudo](https://anilist.co/staff/148792)\n__Generation:__ 4th Gen (holoForce)\n\nTokoyami Towa is a female Japanese Virtual YouTuber associated with hololive.\n\n[YouTube](https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC1uv2Oq6kNxgATlCiez59hw) | [Profile](https://hololive.hololivepro.com/en/talents/tokoyami-towa/) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/tokoyamitowa) | [Bilibili](https://space.bilibili.com/491474051)\n\nIn order to become an archdemon, she joined the human society for further studies.\nShe should be studying but is now addicted to gaming. She realized that the method commonly known as “streaming” is also a way to communicate with humans. She is now in the “trial and error” process.",
