        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b295615-coHD5as4DHmy.png"
        },
        "description": "__Debut date:__ December 4, 2020\n__Height:__ 162 cm\n__Fanbase name:__ Zomrades\n__llustrator:__ [LAM](https://anilist.co/staff/197284)\n__Generation:__ ID 2nd Gen (holoro)\n\nKureiji Ollie is a female Indonesian Virtual YouTuber associated with hololive, debuting as part of its Indonesian (ID) branch second generation of VTubers alongside Anya Melfissa and Pavolia Reine.\n\n[Profile (hololive)](https://hololive.hololivepro.com/en/talents/kureiji-ollie/) | [YouTube](https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCYz_5n-uDuChHtLo7My1HnQ) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/kureijiollie) | [Twitch](https://www.twitch.tv/kureijiollie) | [Facebook](https://www.facebook.com/kureijiollie/) | [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/kureijiollie/)\n\n*\"ZOMBANWA!! SUPER KAWAII ZOMBIE IDOL, KU KU KU KUREIJI OLLIE DESU~!!\"*\n\nA zombie high school girl risen from her grave. She headed home, relying on memories retained from when she was still alive.\nUpon arriving, she discovered it had turned into a ramen shop! And so, in order to reclaim her house, she decided to become a VTuber.\nOllie has a very big tendency to scream. Always lower your volumes during her streams.",
        "gender": "Female",
        "age": "17 forever"
      },
      "voiceActors": []
    },
    {
      "role": "BACKGROUND",
      "node": {
        "id": 295617,
        "name": {
          "full": "Reine Pavolia",
          "native": "パヴォリア・レイネ",
          "alternative": []
        },
        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b295617-8D872NNo4jo5.png"
        },
        "description": "__Debut date:__ December 6, 2020\n__Height:__ 172 cm\n__Fanbase name:__ MERAKyats\n__llustrator:__ [Iida Pochi](https://anilist.co/staff/119988)\n__Generation:__ ID 2nd Gen (holoro)\n\nPavolia Reine is a female Indonesian Virtual YouTuber associated with hololive, debuting as part of its Indonesian (ID) branch second generation of VTubers alongside Kureiji Ollie and Anya Melfissa.\n\n [Profile (hololive)](https://hololive.hololivepro.com/en/talents/pavolia-reine/) | [YouTube](https://www.youtube.com/channel/UChgTyjG-pdNvxxhdsXfHQ5Q) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/pavoliareine) | [Facebook](https://www.facebook.com/pavoliareine) | [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/pavoliareine/)\n\n*\"Perhatian, sang putri merak yang tertiup angin, aku Pavolia Reine dari hololive ID.\"*\n\nLady of the Peafowl. While studying at a magic academy, she was involved in an incident and transferred to the human world.\nSince then, she has been unable to use much of her magic.\nVery fond of sweets, but weak with overly spicy food. At first glance, she seems to be the elegant type, but people who spend some more time with her will find out that she has more of a dorky personality. To quite a number of viewers, her laugh has been perceived as similar to a car engine starting.",
        "gender": "Female",
        "age": null
      },
      "voiceActors": []
    },
    {
      "role": "BACKGROUND",
      "node": {
        "id": 295616,
        "name": {
          "full": "Anya Melfissa",
          "native": "アーニャ・メルフィッサ",
          "alternative": []
        },
        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b295616-fwKnW8jtAbme.png"
        },
        "description": "__Debut date:__ December 5, 2020\n__Height:__ 147 cm\n__Fanbase name:__ Melfriends\n__llustrator:__ [Uekura Eku](https://anilist.co/staff/159591)\n__Generation:__ ID 2nd Gen (holoro)\n\nAnya Melfissa is a female Indonesian Virtual YouTuber associated with hololive, debuting as part of its Indonesian (ID) branch second generation of VTubers alongside Kureiji Ollie and Pavolia Reine.\n\n[Profile (hololive)](https://hololive.hololivepro.com/en/talents/anya-melfissa/) | [YouTube](https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC727SQYUvx5pDDGQpTICNWg) | [Twitter](https://twitter.com/anyamelfissa) | [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/anyamelfissa/)\n\n*\"Good day! This is Anya Melfissa from hololive ID 2nd Generation.\"*\n\nAn ancient weapon known as “Keris,” she was granted human form through a mystical ritual performed by her master.\nShe’s just about always sleeping or playing games. Living mostly alone for so long has made her tend to be apathetic towards things and people she’s uninterested in, but when talking about things she likes, she can be quite childlike and passionate.\nHer base personality is actually apathetic, especially towards humans. Don’t let looks fool you - that’s what every foolish human always does to themselves somehow.",
        "gender": "Female",
        "age": "Confidential"
      },
      "voiceActors": []
